        "displayCode": "TTS / 09",
        "label": "Trust Dialog 1",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "Were you speaking to me, Endministrator? My apologies, I've ... never really followed the standard reporting procedure before. Oh, you just want to talk? Then feel free to ask anything. I'll gladly give you all the details.",
        "japanese": "管理人、今僕に話しかけましたか？実は、報告のやり方とかまだ覚えてなくて……あっ、お話だけですか！それなら、なんでも答えられます！",
