        "label": "Operator Promotion 1",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "You called me over just to praise me? Well, lay it on thicker then. I love hearing the truth!",
        "japanese": "なんだよ、褒めるために呼んだのか？ならもっと褒めろ！てかよ、「本音」聞くのはやっぱ気分いーぜ！",
        "audioUrl": null,
        "playbackMode": "tts"
