        "category": "Greeting",
        "english": "Pogranichnik, Rhodes Island operator, and officer serving the Order of Steel Oath, reporting for duty. The situation is urgent. I respectfully request a brief on your battle plan, at your earliest convenience.",
        "japanese": "ポグラニチニク、ロドスの特派オペレーター兼鉄誓軍士官、ここに着任する。事態は緊急を要す……貴殿の作戦計画を早急に把握したい。可能ならば、今すぐに。",
        "audioUrl": null,
