        "displayCode": "TTS / 06",
        "label": "Operator Reporting for Duty",
        "category": "Greeting",
        "english": "Well, well, look who it is — the legendary Endministrator. I picked up a couple of whispers on my way here. Curious to know which one's the most accurate? Since you don't know me well yet, here's my offer: how about I tell you a secret in exchange for a little something about you? Whaddya reckon?",
