        "displayCode": "TTS / 09",
        "label": "Trust Dialog 1",
        "category": "Talk",
        "english": "People can be pretty complicated sometimes. Back then, I didn't need to think much. My job was all about getting things from A to B. But when I barged into that circus, things got... *Sigh* I'll tell you the full story another time, yeah?",
        "japanese": "人の心って、複雑なの。でも、昔の私にとってはどうでもいいことだった……トランスポーターの仕事は、荷物を届けること。それ以上のことをすれば、逆に自分が……ううん、今はやめておくわ。また今度、ちゃんと話すわね。",
